[For "black"]
[Kind "gambit"]
[Start "caro-classical 3...dxe4"]
[Name "Classical: 4.f3"]

4. f3 { A gambit: White offers the pawn for quick development. }
4... exf3 { Takes it. The engine says the pawn is worth having: White has nothing like enough for it. }
5. Nxf3 Nf6 { Develops, and the knight stops e4. }
6. Bd3 Bg4 { The rule of the opening: the bishop comes out and pins the knight. Black is a pawn up with no problems. } *
